  "texts": {
    "preamble": "S. Ramanjaneyulu vs The State Of A.P. on 7 August, 2020 Author: Ninala Jayasurya Bench: Ninala Jayasurya The Hon'Ble Sri Justice Ninala Jayasurya Criminal Petition No.3052 of 2020 Order:",
    "facts": "2. The present Criminal Petition has been filed seeking quash of FIR No.86 of 2019, dated 11.12.2019 on the file of Vakadu police station, SPSR Nellore District, by invoking the powers under Section 482 Cr.P.C. The said FIR has been registered against the petitioners for the alleged offences under Sections 188, 272, 273 and 328 IPC and Section 59(i) of Food Safety and Standards Act, 2006.",
    "arguments": "3. Learned counsel for the petitioner inter-alia contended that the registration of FIR against the petitioner under the said offences is without jurisdiction and the provisions of the said Act are not attracted to the facts of the present case.",
    "petitioner_arguments": "3. Learned counsel for the petitioner inter-alia contended that the registration of FIR against the petitioner under the said offences is without jurisdiction and the provisions of the said Act are not attracted to the facts of the present case.",
